## Overview
Agora provides a real-time engagement (RTE) platform that powers live, interactive, and AI-driven experiences across voice, video, chat, and streaming.  
Developers use Agora’s SDKs, APIs, and AI extensions to embed real-time audio, video, and data communication into apps for education, gaming, social, and enterprise use cases.

Key capabilities include:
- Global real-time network with ultra-low latency
- Cross-platform SDKs for Web, iOS, Android, Unity, and IoT
- Voice & Video APIs, RTM (Real-Time Messaging), and Chat
- AI extensions (noise suppression, speech-to-text, translation)
- Conversational AI Engine and real-time analytics tools


## Agora Core Platform Features and Benefits
### Real-Time Communication (RTC) Platform
- Ultra-low latency global network — Sub-200ms end-to-end latency across 200+ regions with dynamic routing
- Voice and video SDKs — Cross-platform SDKs for Web, iOS, Android, Unity, Flutter, Electron, and Unreal
- Interactive live streaming — Supports co-hosting, audience participation, virtual gifting, and large-scale broadcasting
- Real-time messaging and signaling — Lightweight data channels for chat, presence, and IoT use cases
- 3D Spatial Audio and AI Noise Suppression — Immersive sound experiences powered by Agora’s AI audio engine
- Cloud recording and playback — Record and retrieve high-quality audio/video sessions on demand
- Analytics and monitoring — Real-time QoS dashboards, event tracing, and post-session analytics
- Enterprise-grade scalability and compliance — Secure, GDPR-ready, SOC2 certified, with private deployment options
- Extensions Marketplace — One-click integration of third-party AI, voice, and vision extensions
- Comprehensive developer tools — CLI, SDKs, REST APIs, sample apps, and extensive documentation

### Convo AI Platform
- End-to-end voice AI agent creation and management — Build, deploy, and monitor real-time AI voice agents
- Composable pipeline architecture — Combine STT, LLM, and TTS modules dynamically in one real-time pipeline
- Bring-your-own models — Integrate your preferred ASR, LLM, and TTS providers (e.g., OpenAI, Soniox, ElevenLabs, MiniMax)
- Real-time streaming with sub-500ms response — Low-latency bi-directional audio streaming optimized for live dialogue
- Multi-language support — 50+ languages with localized voice and speech synthesis options
- Tool-calling and API integration — Enable AI agents to access external APIs and trigger real-time actions
- Automatic evaluation and hallucination detection — Built-in testing and guardrail tools for production readiness
- A/B testing and prompt optimization — Iterate agent performance and conversation flows safely
- Pre-built templates and demo agents — Quickly start from ready-to-use agents for support, sales, or education
- Enterprise-grade hosting and monitoring — Scalable, secure, and fully integrated with Agora’s global RTC network

